  "title": "Celebrating Underdogs With Subaru",
  "summary": "At BARK, we have one goal—Make dogs as happy as they make us. That’s why we’re excited to be joining the Subaru Loves Pets™ initiative in celebrating their 4th annual National Make A Dog’s Day. On October 22, 2022, we’re inviting you to celebrate our weird, wonderful, furry best friends in the best ways you know how. G",
